/*
  Lookup used by int_chatbot_s_c_csi: the corrected_map built inside R
  chatbot_s_c_csi from the ascFuncs package dataset `category_map`
  (ascFuncs/data-raw/category_map_final.xlsx). Here the dataset is embedded as
  the distinct (s, c, csi, s_new, c_new, csi_new) rows in original order
  (seq), so it needs no seed file or shared config. Regenerate from the .rda
  when ascFuncs ships a new category_map.

  R logic reproduced in SQL: pivot the six columns long (s/s_new -> s,
  c/c_new -> c, csi/csi_new -> csi), matcher = lower(value) with spaces removed
  and "/" replaced by "-", then keep the first value per (kind, matcher) in
  row-major pivot order. One row per (kind, matcher).
*/

